\title{Fredrik Bakke}
\author{fredrikbakke}
\meta{author}{false}

\p{
  I am a PhD student at the Norwegian University of Science and Technology, doing work in higher category theory and univalent type theory. I am also a maintainer of the [agda-unimath](agda-unimath) project.
}
\p{
  This is my personal page where I manage my personal notes as well as miscellaneous exposition related to my work. The web page is written using Jon Sterling's [Forester](https://www.jonmsterling.com/jms-005P.xml).
}

